WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:03.500
In the year 2051, mankind takes its first steps on Mars,

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.150
building a base for exploration and science.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.880
But their ship is damaged, and now you must get them home.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.600
Solar flares fry your electronics,

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.600
dust storms knock out your power,

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.030
and meteors damage your base.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.800
And all those surveys showing Mars was a lifeless rock...

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:21.560
...were wrong.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.030
Knowledge is your best weapon.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.200
Upgrade your outpost, rebuild your rocket,

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.050
and fly home!

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.400
Can you survive?
